<title>USA: Most IMM currency futures end lower with weak mark.</title>
<headline>Most IMM currency futures end lower with weak mark.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 8 - IMM currency futures ended mostly lower, led by weakness in Sept marks, which set a new contract low of $0.5703 in pit trade. Spot dollar/mark reached a 41-month high of 1.7617. Yen futures ended day session little changed after early gains erased before current account data are released at 2350 GMT.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
